<view class="home">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-top"><view class="wordmark"><text class="wordmark-icon">城</text><text>城讯通</text></view><view class="hero-action">⌁</view></view>
    <view class="location">⌖ 杭州市 · 西湖区 <text>⌄</text></view>
    <view class="headline">你在意的，<text>就是城市在改变的。</text></view>
    <view class="hero-sub">记录身边的每一个小问题，让公共服务更有温度。</view>
    <view class="hero-shape shape-a"></view><view class="hero-shape shape-b"></view><view class="hero-sun"></view>
    <view class="report-call" bindtap="report"><view><text class="call-kicker">CITY CARE / 01</text><text class="call-title">发现问题，立即上报</text></view><text class="call-arrow">↗</text></view>
  </view>
  <view class="content page">
    <view class="quick card"><view class="quick-copy"><text class="section-title">从这里开始</text><text>选择问题类型，快速提交给相关部门</text></view><view class="problem-grid"><view class="problem" wx:for="{{problems}}" wx:key="name" data-item="{{item}}" bindtap="report"><text class="problem-icon {{item.tone}}">{{item.icon}}</text><text>{{item.name}}</text></view></view><text class="quick-more" bindtap="goCategories">浏览全部问题类型 →</text></view>
    <view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">城市现场</text><text class="section-link" bindtap="goFeed">全部动态 ›</text></view>
    <view class="story card" bindtap="goFeed"><view class="story-art"><text>☼</text><view></view></view><view class="story-info"><text class="eyebrow">城市更新</text><text class="story-title">湖滨步行街的夜晚，亮起来了</text><text class="story-desc">73 盏路灯完成改造，市民夜行更安心。</text><text class="story-meta">今天 · 城市管理局</text></view></view>
    <view class="participation" bindtap="goPoints"><view><text>4,286</text><text>本月市民共同解决的问题</text></view><text>→</text></view>
  </view>
</view>
<view class="bottom-nav"><navigator class="nav active" url="/pages/home/home" open-type="reLaunch"><text class="nav-icon">⌂</text><text>首页</text></navigator><navigator class="nav" url="/pages/orders/orders"><text class="nav-icon">▤</text><text>进度</text></navigator><navigator class="nav nav-report" url="/pages/report/report"><text class="nav-icon">＋</text><text>上报</text></navigator><navigator class="nav" url="/pages/profile/profile"><text class="nav-icon">◉</text><text>我的</text></navigator></view>
